meta {
  name: courses
  type: http
  seq: 1
}

get {
  url: {{base_url}}/courses
  body: none
  auth: bearer
}

params:query {
  ~paged: 1
  ~order: DESC
  ~orderby: title
  ~categories: design,development
  ~tags: beginner
}

auth:bearer {
  token: {{access_token}}
}

docs {
  # GET /courses
  
  Retrieves a paginated list of published courses (catalog).
  
  ## HTTP Method & Route
  - **Method:** `GET`
  - **Route:** `/wp-json/tutor/v1/courses`
  
  ## Authentication
  - **Public:** anonymous access allowed (`permission_optional_access_token`).
  - Bearer JWT optional. Guests receive a reduced catalog-card payload; authenticated callers receive a fuller post DTO.
  - Present but invalid access token → `rest_invalid_access_token` (does not fall back to guest data).
  - When using a JWT, permission comes from the bound API key (`Read`, `Read/Write`, or `All`).
  
  ## Query Parameters
  
  | Parameter | Type | Default | Description |
  | :--- | :--- | :--- | :--- |
  | `paged` | `integer` | `1` | Page number. |
  | `order` | `string` | `DESC` | `ASC` or `DESC`. Invalid / omitted values fall back to **`DESC`**. |
  | `orderby` | `string` | `title` | Whitelisted: `title`, `date`, `modified`, `ID`, `name`, `author`, `menu_order`, `price`. |
  | `categories` | `string` | _None_ | Comma-separated category **names**. |
  | `tags` | `string` | _None_ | Comma-separated tag **names**. |
  
  ## Guest vs authenticated payloads
  
  ### Guest catalog card
  Each post includes: `ID`, `post_title`, `post_name`, `thumbnail_url`, `price`, `sale_price`, `post_author` (`ID`, `display_name`), `ratings` (`rating_count`, `rating_avg`), `course_category` / `course_tag` as `[{ term_id, name, slug }]`.
  
  ### Authenticated
  Full WP post fields (minus `filter` / `post_password`) plus `thumbnail_url`, `sale_price`, `price`, `additional_info`, richer `post_author` (`ID`, `display_name`, `user_nicename`, and private fields when allowed), full `ratings` from `get_course_rating`, and full term objects for category/tag.
  
  ## Responses
  
  ### 200 OK — guest (catalog card)
  ```json
  {
    "code": "tutor_read_course",
    "message": "Course retrieved successfully",
    "data": {
      "posts": [
        {
          "ID": 105,
          "post_title": "Modern JavaScript from Scratch",
          "post_name": "modern-javascript-from-scratch",
          "thumbnail_url": "http://tutor-dev.local/wp-content/uploads/course-js.jpg",
          "price": "49.00",
          "sale_price": "39.00",
          "post_author": {
            "ID": 1,
            "display_name": "Jane Doe"
          },
          "ratings": {
            "rating_count": 12,
            "rating_avg": 4.75
          },
          "course_category": [
            {
              "term_id": 3,
              "name": "Development",
              "slug": "development"
            }
          ],
          "course_tag": [
            {
              "term_id": 8,
              "name": "Beginner",
              "slug": "beginner"
            }
          ]
        }
      ],
      "total_course": 25,
      "total_page": 3
    }
  }
  ```
  
  ### 200 OK — authenticated (excerpt)
  ```json
  {
    "code": "tutor_read_course",
    "message": "Course retrieved successfully",
    "data": {
      "posts": [
        {
          "ID": 105,
          "post_title": "Modern JavaScript from Scratch",
          "post_content": "Course description...",
          "post_status": "publish",
          "post_name": "modern-javascript-from-scratch",
          "thumbnail_url": "http://tutor-dev.local/wp-content/uploads/course-js.jpg",
          "price": "49.00",
          "sale_price": "39.00",
          "post_author": {
            "ID": 1,
            "display_name": "Jane Doe",
            "user_nicename": "jane"
          },
          "additional_info": {
            "course_price_type": ["paid"],
            "course_level": ["all_levels"],
            "disable_qa": false
          },
          "ratings": {
            "rating_count": 12,
            "rating_avg": 4.75,
            "rating_sum": 57,
            "count_by_value": {
              "5": 9,
              "4": 3,
              "3": 0,
              "2": 0,
              "1": 0
            }
          },
          "course_category": [],
          "course_tag": []
        }
      ],
      "total_course": 25,
      "total_page": 3
    }
  }
  ```
  
  ### 404 Not Found
  ```json
  {
    "code": "tutor_read_course",
    "message": "Course not found",
    "data": {
      "status": 404
    }
  }
  ```
}
